-- Guides redesign seeds (lib/guideSetups, lib/guideRoutes).
--
-- 1. Every untouched library gear block gets stable setup ids (the same keys lib/guideSetups
--    setupKey derives, so nothing keyed on them moves), and a setup's DPS spell becomes its spells.
-- 2. Vorkath gets setup pills per level: Rune crossbow (beginner); DHCB with Dizana's quiver, DHL
--    melee (Iron-friendly) and a budget Rune crossbow (intermediate); Twisted bow and DHCB + Masori
--    (advanced) — with fallbacks, tags, spells and steps. Only the untouched seed (version 3) changes.
-- 3. A first progression route: "Ironman: the first 100 hours".
-- Copies that follow the library are rewritten with it, as every library update is.
